<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 99-4 IN 2ND INNINGS V AUSTRALIA - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 99-4 IN 2ND INNINGS V AUSTRALIA - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were 99 for four in their second innings, still 227 runs behind Australia, at the close on the fourth day of the first test at the Wanderers on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 302 and 99-4, Australia 628-8 declared.</p>
